WEBVTT

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.660
Start the test.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:04.620
Roger.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.020
Johnny, get the robot started.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:07.500
Aye.

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:10.490
Giant robot, the flame gun.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.100
Good. Now try the rockets.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:33.450
Fire your rockets.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.620
Whoa, it really worked!

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:03.420
It really worked!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.040
Now, Megaton, punch!

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:08.040
Punch!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.870
It was incredible. Amazing.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:36.930
I've never seen anything like that.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.930
Are you all right? You're not hurt.

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:40.960
Congratulations.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.480
Yes, congratulations.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.920
That is the most powerful metal ever seen by mortal man.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.510
Look at that. It's solid.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.580
And you can see right through it.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.000
The Thadagore, it's really amazing, sir.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.640
This new metal is truly a miracle.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:58.850
Ha, ha, nothing.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:03:59.970
I, uh...

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:06.570
Decided to call it QQV Metal, and I'm giving it to the world to use in the cause of peace.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.420
Thank you. And now Unicorn has a new duty.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:13.160
You will protect this metal. It has to remain a complete secret.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.460
Yes, don't worry, sir. We will be watching it.

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:20.440
Unicorn and the giant robot will keep it safe, sir.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.520
So they invented a transparent metal.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:29.960
I plan to...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:59.640
What are you doing here so late?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:04.340
U-9, headquarters changed the plans. Here's the new orders.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:16.300
You will transfer QQV to a new? I understand. Let's go.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:49.320
You wait here.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:49.860
Yes, sir.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:22.590
Security Squad 1, reporting?

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:25.700
No, all quiet.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.190
Plan to turn over QQV to U-9 is carried out.

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:29.970
What's that?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.090
Nobody ordered such a thing.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:33.370
What?

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.800
You're a sweet fool.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:40.090
Security, report.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.850
This is security one here, all quiet.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.160
Security, report in.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:49.350
Report.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:51.620
Uh-oh.

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:19.790
Oh, no! The gas bomb!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:41.080
My plan's worked, and the medal is ours.

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:47.280
It's transparent, so making submarines and planes with it will mean

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:50.610
it will now be easy to conquer the whole world.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:08.850
Those darn cargoyles. They won't get away this time.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:15.260
No. Unicorn, I'll fix them.

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:19.770
Attention! Claw!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.460
Hey!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.050
What's that?

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:37.950
Goodbye, Unicorn!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:53.010
I'm on a monster!

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.270
The gargoyle's called in!

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.350
I'm calling Giant Robot!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.210
Giant Robot!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:01.550
We'll be right back.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.670
Johnny, now, the sky.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:34.220
Right.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:52.850
Go, catching up.

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.030
Here!

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:49.140
The claw made them run.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.550
Bet they're scared to death.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.100
You have the plans for the invisible QQB metal invented by Unicorn, haven't you?

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.620
I do, sire.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.690
I completely fooled Unicorn and the claw made the giant robot run away.

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:14.750
So, here it is.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:20.520
I can't understand why Unicorn and the giant robot gave up so easily.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:22.110
It's strange, spider.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.670
Open that case at once.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:25.610
Yes, sir, be glad to.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.270
That's an unicorn!

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:40.580
Idiot! QQB, and don't be fooled again!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:42.350
Yes, sir!

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:49.710
Unicorn will probably try to move the QQB to a safer place, with government help.

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:57.690
The science center was attacked, as we expected.

00:11:58.660 --> 00:11:59.960
But your clever substitute...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:06.070
trick the enemy completely they didn't get this sir gargoyle is the enemy they will keep right on

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:13.180
trying sir that's right we understand so our new plan wait just a second i want to check this this

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:18.450
room just could have been bugged you know don't worry about that our security this morning checked

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.380
it completely sir we'll just take a look

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:47.760
There.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:07.220
Well, there we are.

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:10.270
So, you can go ahead now, gentlemen.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:21.200
Decided to move the blueprints for QQV to the United Nations in New York.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.780
Well, that represents a whole new problem, then.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:29.220
What's the best way to transport it to New York?

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.120
We discussed it and decided this.

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:39.020
It can go by plane directly to New York from Hamamatsu Air Base.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.200
But Hamatsu will be dangerous.

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:46.650
Why not let the giant robot handle it?

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.080
It's too dangerous. You need to control the robot.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:52.860
Oh, giant robot will keep me safe, sir.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:59.250
Now then, we will have to act in total secrecy.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.460
You must use a decoy in order to throw them off the track.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:04.580
That should do it.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:22.060
First decoy group will leave at 1310 and will take route B as shown here.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:24.670
And then what will you do?

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:26.820
And then what?

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.900
Well, a new plan.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.000
is... Well, another

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.960
unit with the actual plans

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:37.020
will take course A. Do you understand?

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.770
I do, sir. Unicorn will be working

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.270
in two squads. U3 and U7

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.690
and course A. And I will go with

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:53.300
the other squad. Hey, Jerry, it's time to get going.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:58.620
Right now. Right. Squad A here.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:14:59.740
We're starting now.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:01.190
You seven, okay.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.440
Let's go.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.660
There's nobody on our tail.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:15.230
Good.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:37.380
Open attack! Unicorn cars are built to handle this.

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:01.280
Bye-bye.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:15.150
Out of gas, Johnny.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:16.810
I think they hit our tank.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:23.660
The gas station down there.

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:24.670
Hello, sir.

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:26.320
You'd better just fill it.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:27.160
Glad to, sir.

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.820
Hmm, let's see now.

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:35.330
Hey, Jerry, how did the gargoyles know the route we were taking?

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:38.900
Ah, report to headquarters on this quick.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:41.290
All right, up with your hands.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:44.830
Oh, look, mister.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.080
I want the QQV plans.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.360
That's a hose.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.040
I guess he thinks it's a gun, huh?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:50.960
It is a gun.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:55.900
He isn't kidding.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.760
Yeah, I think he means it, Johnny.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.220
Cut the stalling!

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:05.140
Okay, wise guy!

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:05.560
Hi!

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:10.430
Right there!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:11.500
Giant rope!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:19.220
It has to be there.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:20.990
I'm searching.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:22.190
Yes, sir.

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:37.650
So you are awake. Well, I am glad.

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:41.470
Spider, no use hunting for it.

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:42.870
You don't say.

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:46.350
Well, I heard your headquarters planned the whole thing.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:52.730
Hey, Chief! We've searched everywhere. We can't find the plans.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.630
All right, then. You're gonna talk. Where are they?

00:17:59.290 --> 00:17:59.730
Sorry.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.550
We don't know, do we, Johnny?

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:03.890
You said it!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:05.850
You will talk!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:17.480
Seems you too coy after all.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.420
Unicorn calling? The plan's okay?

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.720
Why, certainly they are.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:28.820
Oh, that's good.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.960
Where are you now?

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:32.560
Think.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.280
Well, wait.

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.960
Now the giant claw will go to work.

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:48.620
Let's go.

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:49.930
We can't waste time.

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:53.620
You're gonna use the claw.

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:55.460
I need my control.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:57.020
I can't get to it.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:29.600
Emergency we're being attacked. It's a monster. I could only get to the watch

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:43.580
You there, you unicorn can handle a little claw, can't they?

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:44.460
You can be in for attack!

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:49.920
Mizzuko!

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:50.500
Johnny!

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:51.660
You're a great...

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:56.060
Giant robot?

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.260
The robot couldn't stop the claw.

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:27.800
Claw!

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:35.340
Soldiers!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:35.760
Treat!

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.930
Hey, Johnny, let me take that gang.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:49.210
You go get the claw.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:49.870
Okay.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.890
Get those plants!

00:21:32.844 --> 00:21:33.404
Go back!

00:21:37.452 --> 00:21:38.012
Now call!

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:40.040
I don't want you to miss anymore, you hear?

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.260
Yeah, and you're in trouble!

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:25.480
Well, it's over thanks to you.

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.120
Commander, we did it.

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:29.460
Say, where's Spider?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:30.500
Hmm?

00:22:31.244 --> 00:22:32.744
I guess he got away again.

00:22:33.644 --> 00:22:35.544
Well, these plans are safe now, anyway.

00:22:35.864 --> 00:22:36.204
Yes?

00:22:36.812 --> 00:22:38.012
The giant robot did it.

00:22:39.116 --> 00:22:39.976
Okay, robot.

00:22:41.484 --> 00:22:41.984
Let's go.

00:22:57.516 --> 00:22:59.956
Plans for the QQV transparent metal.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.960
are saved.

00:23:01.596 --> 00:23:05.356
But Spider and his evil master, Emperor Guillotine, still are free.

00:23:06.012 --> 00:23:07.672
and planning to conquer the world.

00:23:08.796 --> 00:23:10.636
Johnny Sacco and the giant robot.

00:23:11.292 --> 00:23:11.792
MUST!

00:23:12.060 --> 00:23:12.960
Stay on the alert.
